title: An icon goes to the other bar and what it opens goes with it: into the panel of the main bar there, as a card on the other bar while its panel is off; the arrangement is saved
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "left": \[[^\]]*"deps"
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "homes": 3
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left files
wait 600
mark a-everything-at-home
wait 400
right deps
wait 800
mark b-deps-card-from-the-other-bar
wait 400
move deps left
wait 800
mark c-deps-in-the-main-panel-with-its-icon
wait 400
move files right deps
wait 800
mark d-files-open-moved-with-its-icon
wait 400
move files left
wait 800
mark e-files-back-on-the-left
wait 400
quit
